{"id":"102100-44-bccd","year":102,"exam":"102年第二次專門職業及技術人員高等考試牙醫師考試分試考試、藥師、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、助產師、物理治療師、職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師考試","level":"專技高考","subject":"微生物學與臨床微生物學（包括細菌與黴菌）","code":"4311","type":"測驗題","fixed":true,"classes":["醫事檢驗師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=102100&c=311&s=44&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"有關細菌與黴菌之比較，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["細菌為原核細胞，黴菌為真核細胞","細菌皆單一細胞，黴菌皆多細胞","細菌為無性生殖，黴菌可有性生殖","細菌細胞壁含肽聚醣，黴菌細胞壁含葡聚醣和幾丁質"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"下列何種細菌細胞壁含脂質（lipid）成分比例高達60%以上？","opts":["Nocardia","Mycoplasma","Staphylococcus","Streptococcus"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"觀察Corynebacterium diphtheriae的異染顆粒（metachromatic granules）之染色方法為何？","opts":["acid-fast stain","auramine-rhodamine","acridine orange","methylene blue"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"有關Erysipelothrix rhusiopathiae之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["革蘭氏陽性多形性桿菌，老化後易染成陰性長絲狀","是目前已知Erysipelothrix菌屬中唯一對人類致病的菌種","人類感染與職業暴露有關，魚販、屠夫及家庭主婦都是高危險群","觸酶陽性之嗜氧革蘭氏陽性桿菌"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"Diphtheria toxin對人體細胞之主要作用機轉為何？","opts":["產生ADPR與EF-2結合，並抑制其活性，因而抑制胜肽鏈延長","使cyclic AMP濃度上升，細胞膜通透性增加","分解28S rRNA，進而抑制蛋白質合成","使神經肌細胞聯合處無法釋放乙醯膽鹼，因而阻礙神經傳導"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"類丹毒（erysipeloid）之主要致病菌是：","opts":["Corynebacterium ulcerans","Erysipelothrix rhusiopathiae","Rhodococcus equi","Streptococcus pyogenes"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"下列何者為毛工病（woolsorter's disease）或拾荒病（ragpicker's disease）的致病菌？","opts":["Bacillus anthracis","Bacillus cereus","Brucella abortus","Bartonella henselae"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"病人咽喉檢體在Tinsdale's agar上長出帶有棕色暈環（brown halo）之黑色菌落，此病人最可能感染下列何種病原菌？","opts":["Staphylococcus aureus","Corynebacterium diphtheriae","Streptococcus pyogenes","Haemophilus influenzae"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"下列何種病原菌是以人類為天然宿主，而非人畜共通感染之病原菌？","opts":["Bacillus anthracis","Corynebacterium diphtheriae","Erysipelothrix rhusiopathiae","Listeria monocytogenes"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"以modified acid-fast stain染色時，下列何者不會染成紅色？","opts":["Mycobacterium spp.","Rhodococcus spp.","Streptomyces spp.","Tsukamurella spp."],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":11,"q":"下列何者無法使鏈球菌之streptolysin O在sheep blood agar（BAP）上發揮明顯的溶血作用？","opts":["在BAP表面接種後，放厭氧環境培養","將菌與blood agar混合後倒入平板（Pour plate），凝固後放CO 培養箱2","在BAP表面接種後，再於表面劃線接種S. aureus ATCC 25923菌株","在BAP表面接種後，穿刺數下，放CO 培養箱2"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":12,"q":"下列何種菌感染後，最可能併發風濕熱（rheumatic fever）或急性腎絲球體腎炎（acuteglomerulonephritis）？","opts":["Abiotrophia defectiva","Enterococcus faecalis","Streptococcus pyogenes","Viridans group streptococci"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":13,"q":"有關viridans streptococci之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["在sheep BAP上為不溶血或β-溶血的菌種","部分菌株需CO 才能生長2","是人類上呼吸道、腸胃道、女性生殖道之正常菌群","某些具有A、C、G群特異性抗原之菌種含有M protein，與致病力有關"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":14,"q":"下列何項試驗，最不適合用來鑑定Streptococcus agalactiae？","opts":["在New Granada medium（NGM）產色素（carotenoid pigment）之能力","CAMP test","Hippurate hydrolysis test","Susceptibility to Sulfamethoxazole-Trimethoprim"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":15,"q":"以分子診斷法鑑定腸球菌時，下列何者不適合作為目標核酸？","opts":["groESL heat shock protein gene","16S rRNA gene","emm gene","16S-23S rRNA gene spacer sequence"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":16,"q":"下列何種情況最可能導致試管法凝固酶試驗呈偽陽性反應？","opts":["在35℃培養1～4小時後作判讀","在35℃培養隔夜才作判讀","使用citrate抗凝的兔子血漿","使用EDTA抗凝的兔子血漿"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":17,"q":"Staphylococcus aureus被應用在CAMP test，是因其何種產物可與CAMP factor產生協同溶血（synergistic hemolysis）反應？","opts":["α-hemolysin","β-hemolysin","γ-hemolysin","Panton-Valentine leukocidin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":18,"q":"Gram-positive cocci做catalase test時，若反應不確定，下列何項試驗有助於確認？","opts":["Vancomycin感受性試驗","Benzidine test or porphyrin test","Modified oxidase test","測試菌與3% KOH混合，觀察是否會產生黏絲"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":19,"q":"從尿液分離之革蘭氏陽性球菌，catalase (＋)，coagulase (－)，對0.04 unit bacitracin及5μgnovobiocin紙錠均呈抗性，此菌最可能為：","opts":["Aerococcus urinae","Micrococcus luteus","Staphylococcus saprophyticus","Staphylococcus lugdunensis"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":20,"q":"下列何者不是第一線的抗結核菌藥物？","opts":["isoniazid","ethambutol","rifampin","kanamycin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":21,"q":"下列何種方法不適合用於抗methicillin金黃色葡萄球菌（MRSA）流行病學分型？","opts":["PFGE（pulsed-field gel electrophoresis）","emm（M protein gene）typing","spa（protein A gene）typing","MLST（multilocus sequence typing）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":22,"q":"下列何種培養基最適合被用來分離Vibrio spp.？","opts":["Eosin methylene blue（EMB）","MacConkey","Xylose lysine deoxycholate（XLD）","Thiosulfate citrate bile sucrose（TCBS）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":23,"q":"下列何種發酵試驗可用於區分Enterohemorrhagic E. coli（EHEC）及一般的E. coli？","opts":["Mannitol","Dulcitol","Salicin","Sorbitol"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":24,"q":"下列何種細菌不具運動性？","opts":["Escherichia coli","Shigella sonnei","Enterobacter cloacae","Serratia marcescens"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":25,"q":"下列何種細菌在TSIA出現K／A、H S陽性，及urease陽性？2","opts":["Escherichia coli","Klebsiella pneumoniae","Yersinia enterocolitica","Proteus mirabilis"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":26,"q":"下列何種OF試驗結果，可判讀為糖類氧化試驗為陽性？","opts":["封油管與未封油管皆為綠色","封油管綠色，未封油管黃色","封油管與未封油管皆為黃色，皆產氣","封油管與未封油管皆為黃色，皆不產氣"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":27,"q":"在Actinobacillus屬中，與早發性牙周炎（localized juvenile periodontitis）相關之最主要菌種為何？","opts":["A. actinomycetemcomitans","A. hominis","A. suis","A. ureae"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":28,"q":"有關Brucella species的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["會引發人畜共通傳染病（zoonosis）","LPS有兩種主要的antigenic determinants（A和M）","不會產生exotoxin","為胞外生長菌（extracellular organisms）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":29,"q":"有關Helicobacter pylori之敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["Catalase陰性","Urease陰性","Oxidase陽性","Motility陰性"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":30,"q":"有關Campylobacter jejuni subsp. jejuni之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["會發酵葡萄醣","會引起腸胃炎","42℃會生長","會引起神經病變"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":31,"q":"Pontiac fever的病原菌為：","opts":["Brucella spp.","Legionella spp.","Bordetella spp.","Francisella spp."],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":32,"q":"有關Haemophilus influenzae特性之敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["在攝氏50度可存活一天以上","對一般消毒劑極具抗性","發酵乳糖","易有自體溶解現象"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":33,"q":"Haemophilus influenzae的疫苗，主要是針對下列何種血清型？","opts":["type a","type b","type c","type d"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":34,"q":"HACEK群細菌中，下列何者最常引起被人咬傷之傷口感染？","opts":["Haemophilus aphrophilus","Actinobacillus actinomycetemcomitans","Cardiobacterium hominis","Eikenella corrodens"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":35,"q":"下列何者不是腸內菌科乳糖發酵菌的特色？","opts":["具有β-galactosidase","具有β-lactamase","ONPG陽性","在MacConkey agar呈現粉紅色菌落"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列何種細菌在XLD agar出現紅色菌落，其中心點為黑色？","opts":["Escherichia spp.","Salmonella spp.","Shigella spp.","Vibrio spp."],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"Hektoen Enteric（HE）agar所含的pH指示劑為：","opts":["phenol red與thymol blue","Neutral red","Acid fuchsin與thymol blue","Brilliant green與phenol red"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"有關Pseudomonas putida的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["pyoverdin (＋)","Nitrate reduction (＋)","42oC生長(＋)","Gelatin hydrolysis (＋)"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"有關Alcaligenes faecalis在Oxidation-Fermentation（OF）test的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["glucose (＋)，fructose (＋)","glucose (＋)，fructose (－)","glucose (－)，fructose (＋)","glucose (－)，fructose (－)"],"ans":"D","mu