:50,"q":"有關Fusobacterium nucleatum之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["細胞似Fusobacterium varium","Indole陽性","受20% bile抑制","菌落具斑點狀結晶"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":51,"q":"厭氧菌培養基中添加phenylethyl alcohol（PEA）是為了抑制下列何菌之生長？","opts":["Clostridium difficile","Bacteroides fragilis","Staphylococcus aureus","Enterobacter cloacae"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"有關培養厭氧菌所用anaerobic chamber之敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["Palladium-coated alumina可去除氧氣","Methylene blue當酸鹼指示劑","Resazurin當乾燥劑","Silica gel當厭氧催化劑"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"有關Spirillum minus之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["感染會出現疹子","由老鼠傳播","具鞭毛","目前無培養基供培養鑑定"],"ans":"送分","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"黴漿菌（Mycoplasma）細胞的大小約為多少μm？","opts":["0.2到0.3","0.5到1.0","0.5到1.5","1.0到1.5"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"下列何種黴漿菌（mycoplasma）不是人類上呼吸道中的正常菌群（normal flora）？","opts":["M. buccale","M. faucium","M. lipophilum","M. pneumoniae"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"下列關於polymyxin類抗生素之敘述，何者正確？","opts":["具有破壞細菌細胞膜之能力","對革蘭氏陽性菌較有效","會與PBP結合","對人體無毒"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"大部分革蘭氏陰性細菌對萬古黴素（vancomycin)產生抗藥性之主要原因為何？","opts":["萬古黴素水解酶產生","核糖體結合位突變","PBP產生突變","無法穿透胞外膜"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"下列那些抗生素可抑制folinic acid合成路徑？①amikacin ②sulfonamides ③trimethoprim④kanamycin","opts":["①②","②③","③④","①④"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"下列關於trimethoprim之敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["可抑制folinic acid合成路徑","治療Pseudomonas aeruginosa特別有效","常與sulfonamide合併使用","干擾細菌DNA之生合成"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"以agar dilution法進行厭氧菌藥敏試驗時，接種菌量為多少CFU/spot？","opts":["102","103","104","105"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"下列關於多烯（Polyene）類抗黴菌藥物之敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["多烯（Polyene）分子會聚合起來嵌入細胞膜中，造成細胞膜破洞使細胞質內物質流失","Amphotericin B與Nystatin屬此類","Nystatin由於易被腸胃吸收，因此較少用於治療腸胃道黴菌感染","Amphotericin B常用於全身性黴菌感染之治療"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"住院病人若發燒高於38℃，小便困難，且以尿液試紙檢測下列何種項目結果為陽性時，可以判定為院內泌尿道感染？","opts":["磷酸鹽","碳酸鹽","硫酸鹽","硝酸鹽"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"下列關於抗生素感受性試驗之敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["使用培養液稀釋法或瓊脂稀釋法皆可，視細菌生長特性而定","判讀標準可劃分為感受（susceptible）、中間型（intermediate）或抵抗（resistant）三種","MIC小於或等於區分點（breakpoint）濃度可歸為感受性（susceptible）","同一種抗生素對不同微生物之區分點（breakpoint）濃度皆相同"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"下列何種培養基最適合用於結核桿菌藥敏試驗？","opts":["Mueller-Hinton","Middlebrook 7H10","Lowenstein-Jensen（LJ）","Wilkins-Chalgren"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"大腸桿菌血清型O157：H7屬於下列何種致病型？","opts":["EnterotoxigenicE. coli（ETEC）","EnteropathogenicE. coli（EPEC）","EnteroinvasiveE. coli（EIEC）","Enterohemorrhagic","coli（EHEC）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[],"broken":true},{"no":66,"q":"猩紅熱（scarlet fever）之致病菌是：","opts":["Escherichia coli","Enterococcus faecalis","Streptococcus pneumoniae","Streptococcus pyogenes"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"有關體腔與體液的名詞配對，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["Thorax-Pleural fluid","Abdominal cavity-Ascitic fluid","Joint-Synovial fluid","Pericardium-Empyema fluid"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"有性生殖，通常幾個孢子（spore）包在一個子囊內，此種孢子稱為：","opts":["Ascospore","Blastospore","Chlamydospore","Conidiospore"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"下圖為全身性黴菌感染症致病菌，在人體內會產生大（30～60μm）而圓且厚壁的球形體（spherule），內有許多內芽孢（endospore），則此黴菌為：","opts":["粗球孢子菌（Coccidioides immitis）","巴西副球黴菌（Paracoccidioides brasiliensis）","莢膜組織漿菌（Histoplasma capsulatum）","皮炎芽生黴菌（Blastomyces dermatitidis）"],"fig":true,"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"下列那些抗黴菌的機制是抑制麥角醇（ergosterol）合成？①Polyene ②Azole ③Allylamine④Flucytosine","opts":["①②","②③","③④","①③"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"引起真菌腫（Eumycetoma）常見的致病菌為Pseudallescheria boydii（Teleomorph），其無性世代（Anamorph）的名稱為：","opts":["Scedosporium apiospermum","Sporothrix schenckii","Cladophialophora carrionii","Fonsecaea pedrosoi"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"下列何種抗黴菌的機制是抑制DNA及RNA合成？","opts":["Nystatin","Amphotericin B","Cycloheximide","Flucytosine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"下列何種酵母菌（Yeast）芽管試驗（Germ tube test）會出現假芽管（pseudo-germ tubes）？","opts":["Candida lipolytica","Candida krusei","Candida tropicalis","Candida glabrata"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"依規定進行黴菌培養及鑑定的工作，應在下列何種等級的生物安全櫃操作？","opts":["Class I","Class II","Class III","Class VI"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"有關triple sugar iron agar（TSI）之品管試驗，下列何者為最佳標準菌測試組合？","opts":["E. coli、Salmonella、Pseudomonas","E. coli、Klebsiella、Shigella","E. coli、Proteus mirabilis、Shigella","Proteus mirabilis、Salmonella"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"下列何種疾病之感染途徑，為經由tick叮咬所導致？","opts":["登革熱（Dengue fever）","鉤端螺旋體病（Leptospirosis）","傷寒（Typhoid fever）","萊姆氏病（Lyme disease）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"有關細菌及其可能菌落特徵之配對，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["Serratia marcescens－粉紅色菌落","Fusobacterium nucleatum－麵包屑狀菌落","Staphylococcus aureus－金黃色菌落","Chromobacterium spp.－荷包蛋狀菌落"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"骨髓檢體的培養結果如下：BAP培養4天後生長，無溶血；革蘭氏陰性球桿菌；Oxidase陽性；Urease陽性；Motility陰性。應判讀為下列何種菌？","opts":["Brucella spp.","Legionella spp.","Capnocytophaga spp.","Bordetella bronchiseptica"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"有關致病菌與疾病名稱之對應，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["Treponema pallidum引起syphilis","Borrelia burgdorferi引起Lyme disease","Leptospira interrogans引起Weil syndrome","Borrelia recurrentis引起yellow fever"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"下列何者不是屬於性病傳染相關的病原？","opts":["Chlamydophila pneumoniae","Haemophilus ducreyi","Neisseria gonorrhoeae","Chlamydia trachomatis"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}],"answer":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=M&code=102100&c=311&s=44&q=1"}